{%- comment -%}
  UNDER page visual-parity stylesheet — SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for UNDER
  layout overrides. Contains no markup: scopes a shared frame treatment to
  the three UNDER editorial media/text sections by section id. An earlier
  version of this file existed under this same name/path but was removed
  by later work on the page (gone from templates/collection.under.json's
  section order as of this task); this replaces it rather than adding a
  second competing system.

  Values were measured live against the current official reference
  (hair.montibello.com/gama/under/), not carried over from memory:
    - editorial media: 650x462px @1440px viewport (aspect-ratio 650/462),
      border-radius 12px, object-fit: cover — identical numbers to the
      HOP/Luxlight editorial media-frame fix (sections/montibello-hop-
      luxlight-media-frame.liquid), confirmed by measuring UNDER's
      official page separately. Deliberately a SEPARATE file, scoped only
      to UNDER's section ids, rather than extending that HOP/Luxlight file
      — kept as two single-purpose files instead of one multi-page file,
      per this task's instruction not to touch the HOP/Luxlight file.
    - 2-column container: max-width 1300px, column-gap ~48px (visual gap
      to the text column; official implements it as inner text padding,
      applied here as column-gap for the same rendered result)
    - orientation (media_position) already matches official section-by-
      section as configured in templates/collection.under.json — left /
      right / left for stats+carta / Glucamine / Elevated Warmth — and is
      NOT touched here, only frame size/radius.

  Glucamine (glucamine_under) already carries `media_style: framed`, a
  shared modifier on montibello-image-banner.liquid used elsewhere at a
  DIFFERENT radius/ratio (24px, 1350:1080) — that shared rule is not
  edited (other pages use it), it's overridden here at higher specificity
  for this one section id only, matching the measured 12px/650:462 like
  its two UNDER siblings.

  MANAGER FEEDBACK SPRINT (Perú vs España annotated review) added the
  heading-size, spacing and background rules below — previously
  unaddressed in this file. Same measured values as the HOP/Luxlight/
  subfamily sibling file (sections/montibello-hop-luxlight-media-frame.liquid):
  40px/35px heading size, rgb(246, 246, 243) background, 56px row spacing.
  Peru's Glucamine/Elevated Warmth headings measured 48px today, confirming
  the manager's note.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  :is(
    [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
    [id$='__glucamine_under'],
    [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
  ) {
    background-color: rgb(246, 246, 243);
  }

  :is(
    [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
    [id$='__glucamine_under'],
    [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
  ) :is(h1, h2, h3) {
    font-size: 35px !important;
    font-weight: 700 !important;

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      font-size: 40px !important;
    }
  }

  :is(
    [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
    [id$='__glucamine_under'],
    [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
  ) :is(
    .montibello-stats,
    .montibello-banner--split,
    .montibello-feature-rows
  ) {
    max-width: 1300px;

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      /* Base component defaults to `align-items: stretch`, which would
         stretch the media box to match the text column's natural
         height instead of holding the measured 650:462 ratio. */
      align-items: center;
    }
  }

  :is(
    [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
    [id$='__glucamine_under'],
    [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
  ) :is(
    .montibello-stats__media,
    .montibello-banner__media,
    .montibello-feature-rows__media
  ) {
    /* `width: 100%` alongside `aspect-ratio`: without a definite width,
       the stretched-height box (see align-items note above, and any
       leftover min-height from the base component) would derive its
       width FROM height via the ratio instead of from the grid track,
       producing inconsistent frame sizes per section. */
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 650 / 462;
    /* `!important`: montibello-banner--framed (glucamine's `media_style`)
       sets border-radius: 24px at the same specificity as this rule and
       would otherwise win the cascade tie by later source order. */
    min-height: 0 !important;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 12px !important;
    overflow: hidden;

    @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    }
  }

  /* RESPONSIVE GEOMETRY (official hair.montibello.com/gama/under/, UIkit
     breakpoints @m=960 / @l=1200, measured at 1440/1280/1100/1024/900/768):
     - page margin 30px from 960px, 20px below
     - text column inset 50px each side from 1200px (550px text at 1440),
       20px below; the old 20px card padding + 30/50px inner padding made the
       Peru text 450px wide and 50px too far right
     - rows are `align-items: stretch`: the image keeps the 650:462 ratio as a
       minimum and grows with the text (official 357x534 at 768) and the text
       is vertically centred in the same cell
     - Glucamine / Elevated Warmth stack below 960px (text first for the
       media-right row), the Carta de color row stays two-column to 640px. */
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    :is(
      [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
      [id$='__glucamine_under'],
      [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
    ) {
      --under-pad: 20px;

      box-sizing: border-box;
      padding-inline: 20px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 960px) {
    :is(
      [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
      [id$='__glucamine_under'],
      [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
    ) {
      padding-inline: 30px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1200px) {
    :is(
      [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
      [id$='__glucamine_under'],
      [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
    ) {
      --under-pad: 50px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1360px) {
    :is(
      [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
      [id$='__glucamine_under'],
      [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
    ) {
      padding-inline: 0;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    :is(
      [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
      [id$='__glucamine_under'],
      [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
    ) :is(.montibello-stats, .montibello-banner--split, .montibello-feature-rows) {
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    :is(
      [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
      [id$='__glucamine_under'],
      [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
    ) :is(.montibello-stats__media, .montibello-banner__media, .montibello-feature-rows__media) {
      position: relative;
      align-self: stretch;

      :is(img, video) {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }
    }

    :is(
      [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
      [id$='__glucamine_under'],
      [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
    ) :is(.montibello-stats__card, .montibello-banner__content, .montibello-feature-rows__content) {
      align-self: stretch;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-inline: 0;
    }

    /* The shared HOP/Luxlight sheet caps these at 550/560px, adds a 20px
       sibling inset and extra inner padding, all with !important; the whole
       column is the box now, inset by --under-pad. Selectors are deliberately
       heavier (section class + component class) so they win over those. */
    .shopify-section[id$='__stats_carta_under'] .montibello-stats .montibello-stats__media ~ .montibello-stats__card {
      max-width: none !important;
      padding-inline: 0 !important;
    }

    .shopify-section[id$='__stats_carta_under'] .montibello-stats .montibello-stats__card > :is(.text-block, .montibello-stats__data) {
      max-width: none !important;
      padding-inline: var(--under-pad) !important;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1359px) {
      /* official leaves 40px between the heading and the first stat (Peru 16px) */
      .shopify-section[id$='__stats_carta_under'] .montibello-stats .montibello-stats__data {
        margin-top: 24px;
      }
    }

    .shopify-section[id$='__glucamine_under'] .montibello-banner--split .montibello-banner__media ~ .montibello-banner__content {
      max-width: none !important;
      padding-inline: var(--under-pad) !important;
    }

    .shopify-section[id$='__glucamine_under'] .montibello-banner--split .montibello-banner__content .text-block {
      max-width: none !important;
    }

    .shopify-section[id$='__elevated_warmth_under'] .montibello-feature-rows .montibello-feature-rows__media ~ .montibello-feature-rows__content {
      max-width: none !important;
      padding-inline: var(--under-pad) !important;
    }

    /* official headings use -3% tracking in all three rows (Peru only had it
       on Elevated Warmth, so Glucamine wrapped to three lines) and the
       Elevated Warmth heading box is 470px wide */
    .shopify-section:is(
        [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
        [id$='__glucamine_under'],
        [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
      ) :is(h1, h2, h3) {
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .shopify-section[id$='__elevated_warmth_under'] .montibello-feature-rows .montibello-feature-rows__heading {
      max-width: 470px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) and (max-width: 1359px) {
    /* official rows are 50px apart (25px above + 25px below each); Peru's
       banner row added 24px of its own padding on top of that */
    .shopify-section:is(
        [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
        [id$='__glucamine_under'],
        [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
      ) :is(.montibello-stats, .montibello-banner--split, .montibello-feature-rows) {
      padding-block: 0 !important;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) and (max-width: 959px) {
    :is([id$='__glucamine_under'], [id$='__elevated_warmth_under'])
      :is(.montibello-banner--split, .montibello-feature-rows) {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      row-gap: 25px;
    }

    :is([id$='__glucamine_under'], [id$='__elevated_warmth_under'])
      :is(.montibello-banner__content, .montibello-feature-rows__content) {
      padding-block: 0;
    }

    /* official stacked rows sit 30px apart (Peru: ~75px from section + row padding) */
    .shopify-section:is([id$='__glucamine_under'], [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']) {
      padding-block: 15px !important;

      :is(.montibello-banner--split, .montibello-feature-rows) {
        padding-block: 0 !important;
      }
    }

    [id$='__glucamine_under'] .montibello-banner__content :is(p, .text-block) {
      max-width: none !important;
    }

    /* official headings step down to 35px below the 960px breakpoint */
    .shopify-section:is(
        [id$='__stats_carta_under'],
        [id$='__glucamine_under'],
        [id$='__elevated_warmth_under']
      ) :is(h1, h2, h3) {
      font-size: 35px !important;
      line-height: 35px !important;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    [id$='__product_range_under'] .montibello-product-range__grid {
      /* `!important`: the product-range component sets this grid inside a
         higher-specificity nested rule. */
      max-width: 1300px !important;
      margin-inline: auto;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 248px)) !important;
      justify-content: center !important;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

